  unitName: Tyrant Lilly Matah
  unitId: 60495
  unitNumber: 627
  description: Long before the battle between the humans and the gods, there was
    a fearful empress from the Agni empire whose name was inscribed in history. Some
    years after her enthronement she began invading the neighboring countries. It
    is rumored that she did so in order to gather more slave fighters, but this cannot
    be proven as fact. There were some slaves who aimed to take her life, but due
    to the tremendous dark power she gained through her research, none could approach
    her. After her death, her daughter would continue this same research, bringing
    down the fall of the empire with it.
  summonDesc: The saga of a relentless person.<br>Humans are equivalent to beasts.<br>In
    my eyes, everyone is equal.
  fusionDesc: I could feel your loyalty<br> towards me.<br>What do you wish for as
    a reward?
  evoDesc: My evolution was only natural.<br>That's because I'm a fool<br>who cannot
    help fighting.
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
